.env
# The whole `.local` family, not just `.env.local`. Next loads
# `.env.$(NODE_ENV).local` at higher precedence than `.env.local`, so
# `.env.development.local` is an equally standard place to put the real key and
# was not ignored when only the bare spelling was listed. This is what
# create-next-app ships.
.env*.local
